From 14c3332121d0f8375649d6af5ddb18fb16633e22 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: vince <vincepaul.liem@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 16:38:05 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] feat(storage): mediate file locks with virtual ownership

Support bounded POSIX record locks on owned regular-file inodes and flock
locks on owned open descriptions. Keep process and description lifetime
distinct across aliases, fork, exec and death; park conflicting blocking
requests in the existing supervisor and retain native lock denial.

Signed-off-by: vince <vincepaul.liem@gmail.com>
